OL,3,ACIA chief in Moscow for unannounced
OL,4,Atalks, US media reports
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe head of the US Central Intelligence
OL,7,FAgency (CIA) travelled to Moscow for
OL,8,Funannounced talks, the BBC's US news
OL,9,Fpartner CBS has reported.
OL,11,FJohn Ratcliffe reportedly arrived in
OL,12,Fthe Russian capital earlier on Tuesday.
OL,13,FNeither Washington or Moscow have
OL,14,Fconfirmed the nature of the visit or
OL,15,Fwho he was due to meet.
OL,17,FIn-person talks between high-level
OL,18,FAmerican and Russian officials are
OL,19,Frare.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
